// BROKEN ON PURPOSE -- open this file to see the server's diagnostics.
//   * `statemachin` is one edit away from the keyword, which the repair pass
//     names in its message;
//   * the last state never reaches its `end`.
statemachin Lamp

events toggle

initialState Off

/** The lamp is off. */
state Off
    toggle => On
end

/** The lamp is on. */
state On
    toggle => Off
